[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
arcana-agent runs on each host, as root; see arcana-agent(8).  The short
way is to enrol the host from the console, which gives a one-time command:

  arcana-enrol -s https://console.example <token>

The console (CONSOLE option) runs kore(1) as an unprivileged user:

  pw useradd arcana -d /var/db/arcana -s /usr/sbin/nologin
  install -d -o arcana -m 0700 /var/db/arcana
  edit %%PREFIX%%/etc/arcana/kore.conf and web.conf
  sysrc arcana_console_enable=YES && service arcana_console start

Its TLS certificate must be RSA: Kore's key manager signs nothing else.
The first login needs the token in /var/db/arcana/setup-token.
EOM
}
]
